'''R.Ost''' (ダチョウ同好会, ''Dachō Dōkōkai'', '''Ostrich Club''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[The Aku Realms]] and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.6 Update|Version 2.2.6]].

